{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q398", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thamizhar_kudumba_murai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "manaiyol_term", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘மனை’ என்பது வீட்டின் மையத்தைக் குறிப்பது போல, இல்லத்தின் தலைவியாக விளங்கிய பெண் எவ்வாறு அழைக்கப்பட்டாள்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அரசி", "B": "மனையோள் (இல்லத்தலைவி)", "C": "தோழி", "D": "செவிலித்தாய்"}, "explanation": "இல்லத்தின் நிர்வாகத் தலைவியாக விளங்கிய பெண் ‘மனையோள்’ எனச் சங்க இலக்கியங்களில் சிறப்பிக்கப்பட்டாள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Just as 'Manai' signified the sanctum of the home, what classical title honored the female head of the household?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Arasi", "B": "Manaiyol (Mistress / ruler of the hearth)", "C": "Thozhi", "D": "Sevilitthai"}, "explanation": "The female head of the family was reverently termed 'Manaiyol' in Sangam poetry."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 48, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 48", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "pre