{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q403", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thamizhar_kudumba_murai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kinship_terms_match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பண்டைய தமிழர் முறைப்பெயர்களைப் பொருத்துக:\n1. அம்மை / ஆய் - அ) தந்தை\n2. அப்பன் / அத்தன் - ஆ) தாய்\n3. தமக்கை - இ) தம்பி\n4. பின்னோன் - ஈ) அக்காள்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-அ, 2-ஆ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ", "B": "1-ஈ, 2-இ, 3-ஆ, 4-அ", "C": "1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ", "D": "1-இ, 2-ஈ, 3-அ, 4-ஆ"}, "explanation": "அம்மை/ஆய் - தாய் (ஆ); அப்பன்/அத்தன் - தந்தை (அ); தமக்கை - அக்காள் (ஈ); பின்னோன் - தம்பி (இ). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the ancient Tamil kinship terms with their semantic meanings:\n1. Ammai / Aai - a) Father\n2. Appan / Atthan - b) Mother\n3. Thamakkai - c) Younger brother\n4. Pinnoan - d) Elder sister", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a", "C": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c", "D": "1-c, 2-d, 3-a, 4-b"}, "explanation": "Ammai: Mother (b); Appan: Father (a); Thamakkai: Elder sister (d); Pinnoan: Younger brother (c)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Cor