{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q412", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thamizhar_kudumba_murai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "father_society_shift", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாய்வழிச் சமூகத்திலிருந்து தந்தைவழிச் சமூகமாக மாறியதற்கு முதன்மைக் காரணியாக அமைந்தது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வானிலை மாறுபாடுகள்", "B": "மொழியின் வளர்ச்சி", "C": "மதங்களின் தோற்றம்", "D": "தனிச்சொத்துடைமை தோன்றி, நிலமும் கால்நடைகளும் ஆண்களின் கட்டுப்பாட்டிற்குள் வந்தமை"}, "explanation": "வேளாண்மையும் கால்நடைப் பெருக்கமும் தனியுடைமையாக மாறி, அவற்றை ஆண்களே நிர்வகித்தபோது தந்தைவழிச் சமூகம் மேலோங்கியது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What historical-economic transition drove the shift from matrilineal to patrilineal social organization?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Climatic changes", "B": "Evolution of script", "C": "Rise of organized religions", "D": "Emergence of private property where land, herds, and surplus became consolidated under male control"}, "explanation": "The rise of private property, agrarian surplus, and livestock under male dominance catalyzed the patrilineal shift."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educa