{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q459", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "kambaramayanam_u3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kandams_padalams_match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கம்பராமாயணக் காண்டங்களையும் அவற்றில் இடம்பெறும் படலங்களையும் பொருத்துக:\n1. அயோத்தியா காண்டம் - அ) சடாயு உயிர்நீத்த படலம்\n2. ஆரணிய காண்டம் - ஆ) குகப் படலம்\n3. யுத்த காண்டம் - இ) வாலி வதைப் படலம்\n4. கிட்கிந்தா காண்டம் - ஈ) வீடணன் அடைக்கலப் படலம்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-அ, 2-ஆ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ", "B": "1-ஈ, 2-இ, 3-ஆ, 4-அ", "C": "1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ", "D": "1-இ, 2-ஈ, 3-அ, 4-ஆ"}, "explanation": "அயோத்தியா காண்டம் - குகப் படலம் (ஆ); ஆரணிய காண்டம் - சடாயு உயிர்நீத்த படலம் (அ); யுத்த காண்டம் - வீடணன் அடைக்கலப் படலம் (ஈ); கிட்கிந்தா காண்டம் - வாலி வதைப் படலம் (இ). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Kandams with their corresponding Padalams in Kambaramayanam:\n1. Ayodhya Kandam - a) Jatayu Uyirneetha Padalam\n2. Aranya Kandam - b) Guha Padalam\n3. Yuddha Kandam - c) Vali Vadhai Padalam\n4. Kishkindha Kandam - d) Vibhishana Adaikkala Padalam", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a", "C": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c", "D": "1-c, 2-d, 3-a, 4-b"}, "explanation": "Ayodhya: Guha (b); Aranya: Jatayu (a); Yuddha: Vibhishana (d); Kishkindha: Vali (c)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 53, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 53", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 3", "Kambaramayanam", "Matching Kandams"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q460", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "kambaramayanam_u3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "universal_brotherhood_theme", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கம்பராமாயணத்தில் கம்பர் இராமன் பாத்திரத்தின் வழியாகப் புலப்படுத்தும் தலையாய மானுட மாண்பு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அரச போகம்", "B": "ஆதிக்க உணர்வு", "C": "சாதி வேற்றுமை பாராட்டுதல்", "D": "சாதி, இனம், குலம், நாடு கடந்து அனைத்து உயிர்களையும் உடன்பிறப்பாக நேசிக்கும் எல்லையற்ற உலகளாவிய சகோதரத்துவம்"}, "explanation": "வேடன் குகன், கழுகு சடாயு, எளிய முதியவள் சவரி, வானரன் சுக்ரீவன், எதிரியின் தம்பி வீடணன் அனைவரையும் சகோதரர்களாக ஏற்கும் மாண்பே கம்பரின் செய்தி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What overarching humanistic virtue does Kambar champion through the character of Rama?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Imperial hedonism", "B": "Chauvinistic hegemony", "C": "Caste hierarchy segregation", "D": "Universal fraternity embracing all beings regardless of caste, species, tribe, or race as brothers"}, "explanation": "Kambar projects universal brotherhood embracing the hunter Guha, vulture Jatayu, ascetic Sabari, monkey Sugriva, and enemy's brother Vibhishana."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 56", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 3", "Kambaramayanam", "Universal Brotherhood"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q461", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "kambaramayanam_u3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kambar_other_works", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கம்பர் இயற்றிய பிற நூல்களுள் பொருந்தாத நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குற்றாலக் குறவஞ்சி", "B": "சடகோபர் அந்தாதி", "C": "சரசுவதி அந்தாதி", "D": "ஏரெழுபது, சிலைஎழுபது, திருக்கை வழக்கம்"}, "explanation": "சடகோபர் அந்தாதி, சரசுவதி அந்தாதி, ஏரெழுபது, சிலைஎழுபது, திருக்கை வழக்கம் ஆகியவை கம்பரின் நூல்கள்; ‘குற்றாலக் குறவஞ்சி’ திரிகூடராசப்பக் கவிராயரின் நூல்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following texts was NOT composed by epic poet Kambar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kutralak Kuravanji", "B": "Sadagopar Andhadhi", "C": "Saraswathi Andhadhi", "D": "Earezhabadhu, Silaiyezhabadhu, Thirukkai Vazhakkam"}, "explanation": "Kutralak Kuravanji was authored by Thirikooda Rasappa Kavirayar, while the others are authentic works of Kambar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 53, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 53", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 3", "Kambaramayanam", "Other Works"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q462", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "kambaramayanam_u3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "valmiki_source", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கம்பராமாயணத்திற்கு முதல் நூலாக அமைந்த வடமொழி நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வியாசரின் மகாபாரதம்", "B": "வான்மீகி முனிவர் இயற்றிய வடமொழி இராமாயணம்", "C": "பாஸரின் நாடகங்கள்", "D": "காளிதாசனின் ரகுவம்சம்"}, "explanation": "கம்பர் வான்மீகி முனிவர் இயற்றிய வடமொழி இராமாயணத்தைத் தழுவித் தமிழ் மரபுக்கேற்ப ‘இராமாவதாரம்’ என்னும் வழிநூலாகப் படைத்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Sanskrit epic served as the primary source text for Kambar's Tamil adaptation?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vyasa's Mahabharata", "B": "Sage Valmiki's Sanskrit Ramayana", "C": "Bhasa's dramas", "D": "Kalidasa's Raghuvamsa"}, "explanation": "Sage Valmiki's Sanskrit Ramayana was the source text, which Kambar transcreated into Tamil idiom."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 53, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 53", "url"