{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q492", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "urimaithaagam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poomani_novels_match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பூமணியின் படைப்புகளை அவற்றின் இலக்கிய வகையோடு பொருத்துக:\n1. அஞ்ஞாடி - அ) திரைப்படம் உருவான நாவல்\n2. வெக்கை - ஆ) 2014 சாகித்திய அகாதெமி நாவல்\n3. அறுப்பு - இ) சிறுகதைத் தொகுப்பு\n4. பிறகு - ஈ) நாவல்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-அ, 2-ஆ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ", "B": "1-ஈ, 2-இ, 3-ஆ, 4-அ", "C": "1-இ, 2-ஈ, 3-அ, 4-ஆ", "D": "1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ"}, "explanation": "அஞ்ஞாடி - சாகித்திய அகாதெமி (ஆ); வெக்கை - திரைப்படம் உருவானது (அ); அறுப்பு - சிறுகதை (இ); பிறகு - நாவல் (ஈ). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match Poomani's works with their distinctive literary landmarks:\n1. Agnjaadi - a) Novel adapted into film Asuran\n2. Vekkai - b) 2014 Sahitya Akademi award novel\n3. Aruppu - c) Short story anthology\n4. Piragu - d) Celebrated novel", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a", "C": "1-c, 2-d, 3-a, 4-b", "D": "1-b, 2-a, 3-c, 4-d"}, "explanation": "Agnjaadi: Sahitya Akademi (b); Vekkai: Asuran film (a); Aruppu: Short stories (c); Piragu: Novel (d)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book"