{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q537", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_u3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thinai_panai_comparison", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘திணைத்துணை நன்றி செயினும் பனைத்துணையாக்\nகொள்வர் பயன்தெரி வார்’ - இக்குறட்பா உணர்த்தும் ஒப்புமை யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திணை அளவு சிறிய உதவியையும், அதன் பயன் தெரிந்த சான்றோர்கள் பனைமரம் போலப் பெரிதாக மதித்துப் போற்றுவர்", "B": "திணை பயிரை விடப் பனைமரம் சிறந்தது", "C": "சிறிய உதவியைச் செய்யக் கூடாது", "D": "பனை மரத்தை மட்டுமே வளர்க்க வேண்டும்"}, "explanation": "திணையளவு மிகச் சிறிய உதவியாக இருந்தாலும் அதன் அருமையை உணர்ந்தவர் அதனைப் பனைமரத்தின் அளவுக்குப் பேருதவியாகக் கருதுவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What moral comparison is articulated in 'Thinaithunai nandri seyinum panaithunaiyaak kolvar payandheri vaar'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The noble who grasp intrinsic value regard a favor as small as a millet seed (thinai) as vast as a towering palmyra tree (panai)", "B": "Palmyra trees surpass millet crops", "C": "Small favors must never be performed", "D": "Cultivate palmyra trees exclusively"}, "explanation": "A tiny favor as small as a millet seed is regarded as colossal as a palmyra tree by the wise."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 64, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 3, Page 64", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 3", "Thirukkural", "Millet Palmyra Simile"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q538", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_u3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ungrateful_heinous_sin", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘எந்நன்றி கொன்றார்க்கும் உய்வுண்டாம் உய்வில்லை\n_________ கொன்ற மகற்கு’ - எத்தகைய நன்றியை மறந்தவனுக்கு மன்னிப்பே கிடையாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருள் கொடுத்த நன்றி", "B": "செய்ந்நன்றி கொன்ற மகற்கு (செய்த உதவியை மறந்து அழித்தவனுக்கு)", "C": "உணவு தந்த நன்றி", "D": "சொல் நன்றி"}, "explanation": "எந்தப் பெரிய அறத்தை அழித்தவருக்கும் கழுவாய் (மன்னிப்பு) உண்டு; ஆனால் ஒருவர் செய்த உதவியை மறந்து அழித்த கொடியோனுக்கு மீட்சியே கிடையாது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Kural 110, expiation exists for all sins, but no redemption ever exists for whom?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "One who fails to repay loans", "B": "One who murders gratitude by betraying a favor received (Seindrandri kondra magatku)", "C": "One who wastes food", "D": "One who breaks verbal oaths"}, "explanation": "Expiation exists for any heinous crime, but there is no salvation for the ungrateful wretch who slays gratitude."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and E