{"id": "12th_tamil_u3_q544", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_3", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_u3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural_terms_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருக்குறள் சொற்களையும் அவற்றின் பொருளையும் பொருத்துக:\n1. ஞாலம் - அ) தெப்பம் / படகு\n2. புணை - ஆ) உலகம்\n3. பூரியார் - இ) பாதுகாப்பு\n4. ஏமம் - ஈ) இழிந்தவர்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-அ, 2-ஆ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ", "B": "1-ஈ, 2-இ, 3-ஆ, 4-அ", "C": "1-இ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-ஆ", "D": "1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ"}, "explanation": "ஞாலம் - உலகம் (ஆ); புணை - தெப்பம்/படகு (அ); பூரியார் - இழிந்தவர் (ஈ); ஏமம் - பாதுகாப்பு (இ). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the classical Kural vocabulary with their definitions:\n1. Gnaalam - a) Raft / Boat (Punai)\n2. Punai - b) World / Earth (Gnaalam)\n3. Pooriyaar - c) Shield / Protection (Aemam)\n4. Aemam - d) Ignoble person (Pooriyaar)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a", "C": "1-c, 2-a, 3-d, 4-b", "D": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c"}, "explanation": "Gnaalam: Earth (b); Punai: Raft (a); Pooriyaar: Base person (d); Aemam: Safety (c)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and 